#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/hasBeian/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hasBeian/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/hasBeian/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"The value indicates whether all the hostnames in this property have Beian "
"license on file with the Chinese government. This is required to serve this "
"property from servers in mainland China. A value of <i>false</i> means "
"servers outside of mainland China will be used to distribute content to "
"visitors in China. If set to <i>true</i> you must also specify the content "
"type in the <i>beianContentType</i> field."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/configs/properties/beianContentType/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions~1{version}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/beianContentType/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1properties~1{propertyID}~1versions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/beianContentType/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
