#. /paths/~1cdn~1deploymentTasks/post/description
msgid ""
"Create a deployment task to deploy your property or certificate to the "
"staging or production environments or to remove the property or certificate. "
"The staging environment allows you to test your property to ensure correct "
"behavior before you make it available to end users. Refer to [testing a "
"property](</docs/portal/edge-configurations/testing-property>) for more "
"information.\n"
"\n"
"If a property uses a certificate, an error will be returned by this API if "
"the certificate has not yet been deployed to the target environment. For "
"server certificates, an error will be returned if the certificate's Subject "
"Alternative Name (SAN) does not include the hostnames specified in the "
"property version. A SAN with a wildcard hostname will support subdomains "
"only at the same level as the wildcard. For instance, the wildcard "
"'*.xyz.com' supports 'abc.xyz.com' but not 'def.abc.xyz.com'.\n"
"\n"
"After a property version is deployed, it will be frozen to prevent "
"additional changes. You can modify the property by <a href=\"#operation/"
"createPropertyVersion\">creating a new property version</a> with your "
"desired changes."
msgstr ""

