msgid ""
"Indicates the type of data returned. \n"
"<table>\n"
"<tr><th>Data Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>edge response</td><td>edge traffic to visitors</td></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>edge request</td><td>traffic from visitors to edge servers</td></"
"tr>\n"
"<tr><td>intermediate response</td><td>traffic from intermediate CDN Pro "
"servers to other CDN Pro servers</td></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>intermediate request</td><td>traffic of requests to intermediate CDN "
"Pro servers</td></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>origin response</td><td>traffic from origin servers</td></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>origin request</td><td>traffic to origin servers</td></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>fast route response</td><td>traffic from your origin accelerated "
"through the HDT product</td></tr>\n"
"<tr><td>fast route request</td><td>traffic to your origin accelerated "
"through the HDT product</td></tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"The order of the entries in <i>dataNames</i> array corresponds to the order "
"of values returned in the <i>data</i> data array in the response."
msgstr ""

