#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/post/description
msgid ""
"Get a summary of edge, intermediate (between CDN Pro servers), and origin "
"traffic volume during a time period. You can filter and group results by "
"hostnames, server groups, property IDs, or property hostnames. If you are a "
"reseller, you can also filter and group by customerIds to distinguish your "
"child customers' traffic.\n"
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/post/parameters/1/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/post/parameters/1/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volL7Summary/get/parameters/1/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the end of the time span. The time must be "
"specified using the UTC timezone; it cannot be an offset. Example: "
"<code>enddate=2019-10-30T00:00:00Z</code>. Due to latency associated with "
"processing new traffic data, enddate should be no later than five minutes "
"before the current time. This ensures you get the most accurate results."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/post/parameters/2/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/get/parameters/2/description
msgid "Limit the results to the specified scheme."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/title
msgid "reportfiltersummary"
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/description
msgid ""
"An object that can be passed to summary report API calls to filter and group "
"the results. For example, you can specify to return data only for a "
"particular hostname. Resellers can also filter and group by customer IDs to "
"distinguish their child customers."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/serverGroups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/serverGroups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/serverGroups/description
#. (+3 more)
msgid "Indicates one or more server groups."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/customerIds/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/customerIds/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1bandwidthSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/customerIds/description
msgid "Resellers can limit the data by specifying IDs of child customers."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groupBy/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groupBy/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using a combination of up to two of the following: "
"'hostnames', 'serverGroups',  'customerIds', 'propertyIds', "
"'propertyHostnames', and 'legacyTypes'. Only resellers can specify "
"'customerIds'."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/get/description
msgid ""
"Get a summary of edge, intermediate (between CDN Pro servers), and origin "
"traffic volume during a time period. Query parameters let you specify the "
"time period, scheme, and whether to group the results. If you are a "
"reseller, you can also group by customerIds to distinguish your child "
"customers' traffic and requests."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/get/parameters/1/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the end of the time span. The time must be "
"specified using the UTC timezone; it cannot be an offset. Example: "
"<code>enddate=2019-10-30T00:00:00Z</code>. Due to latency associated with "
"new traffic data, enddate should be no later than five minutes before the "
"current time. This ensures you get the most accurate results."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1volSummary/get/parameters/3/description
msgid ""
"You can group results using any combination of up to two of 'hostnames', "
"'serverGroups', 'customerIds', ' propertyHostnames', 'propertyIds', and "
"'legacyTypes' by specifying a comma-separated list of the keywords. Only "
"resellers can specify 'customerIds'."
msgstr ""

