"URL to the new account. You can use the ID to get information about the "
"account or to update it. The URL follows this format: https://ngapi."
"{{siteDomain}}/ngadmin/contacts/{userId} where {userId} represents the ID of "
"the newly created account. If you would like to get the user ID, simply "
"extract the last portion of the path and ignore the rest. The ID can be used "
"to query, update, or delete the user account."
