"href=\"#operation/post-cdn-apiPermissions\">API to create custom "
"permissions</a> for it and define the endpoints that can be accessed. After "
"that, you can make additional changes by calling our <a href=\"#operation/"
"patch-cdn-apiPermissions-id\">API to modify the permissions</a>."
msgstr ""

