"Get the number of DNS requests to resolve your edge hostnames during a time "
"period."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReq/post/parameters/1/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReqSummary/post/parameters/0/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReqSummary/get/parameters/0/description
#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the beginning of the time period. The time must be "
"specified using the UTC timezone; it cannot be an offset. Example: "
"<code>startdate=2019-11-14T00:00:00Z</code>"
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReq/post/parameters/2/description
msgid ""
"RFC 3339 date indicating the end of the time span. The time must be "
"specified using the UTC timezone; it cannot be an offset. Example: "
"<code>enddate=2019-11-14T00:00:00Z</code>"
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReq/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/description
msgid "Limit statistics to specific edge hostnames."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReq/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/edgeHostnames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReqSummary/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/filters/properties/edgeHostnames/description
msgid "One or more edge hostnames."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReq/post/requestBody/description
msgid ""
"Optionally specify the edge hostnames to obtain statistics for them. If "
"unspecified, data for all edge hostnames in your account will be returned."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReqSummary/post/summary
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReqSummary/get/summary
msgid "Get edge hostname summary statistics"
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReqSummary/post/responses/200/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReqSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReqSummary/get/responses/200/description
#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"The response contains a summary of DNS requests by edge hostname. It can "
"contain up to 10000 groups representing a breakdown of requests by 10000 "
"edge hostnames. If there are more than 10000 groups, the value of "
"\"isComplete\" will be false. A special group \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" contains "
"the total for all groups including those beyond the 10000 limit.  When "
"\"isComplete\" is true, the total is the sum of all other returned groups."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReqSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeHostnameReqSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
msgid "edgeHostnameSummaryResponse"
msgstr ""

