#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1customers~1{id}/patch/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/portalSettings/properties/logoutIdleTime/description
#. /paths/~1ngadmin~1customers~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/portalSettings/properties/logoutIdleTime/description
