#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/suspensionDate/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/suspensionDate/description
