#. (+2 more)
msgid ""
"List of advanced features that are available to the customer. Currently "
"supported features include: \"realTimeLog\", which allows a customer to "
"monitor requests from their client as they are received; \"nearChina\" "
"allowing a customer without ICP Beian to use a server group consisting of "
"nodes close to mainland China; and \"originShield\", which provides an extra "
"layer of servers between the CDN Pro edge servers and origin servers. Please "
"contact our support team if you require an advanced feature."
