#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDollar/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDollar/description
msgid ""
"This setting applies to trial customers. It represents the amount of traffic "
"valued in US dollars that is permitted to be used over a period of time  set "
"by the <i>usageLimitDays</i> field. For example, a value of 90 for "
"<i>usageLimitDays</i> and 50 for <i>usageLimitDollar</i> means the customer "
"can use up to $50 worth of total traffic over a 90 day period. The dollar "
"value is based on CDN Pro's default pricing.\n"
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDays/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/usageLimitDays/description
msgid ""
"This setting applies to trial customers. It is used to limit traffic use. It "
"represents the number of days over which the traffic amount designated by "
"the <i>usageLimitDollar</i> field can be used. For example, a value of 90 "
"for <i>usageLimitDays</i> and 50 for <i>usageLimitDollar</i> means the "
"customer can use up to $50 worth of total traffic over a 90 day period.\n"
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/items/properties/hasBeian/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/edgeHostnameZones/items/properties/hasBeian/description
msgid ""
"Whether the domain has ICP Beian which is required for content to be hosted "
"on servers in China. If set to true, every property's hostname that points "
"to an edge hostname using this domain must have ICP Beian."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1{serviceQuotaId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedServerGroups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1serviceQuotas~1customer~1{customerId}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedServerGroups/description
msgid ""
"List of server groups the customer is permitted to use. This can be used to "
"manage costs. Access to a higher level server group includes access to lower "
"level groups. In particular, <i>ultra</i> includes <i>standard</i>, "
"<i>premium</i>, and <i>deluxe</i>; <i>deluxe</i> includes <i>premium</i> and "
"<i>standard</i>; <i>premium</i> includes <i>standard</i>; and "
"<i>ChinaPremium</i> includes <i>ChinaStandard</i>."
msgstr ""

