msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/prefetchRequests/items/properties/submissionTime/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1prefetches~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metadata/properties/submissionTime/description
