msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/webhooks/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/webhooks/description
