msgid ""
"Whether the API account can access the <a href=\"#tag/Webhooks\">webhooks</"
"a> (/cdn/webhooks) endpoints. The value 'read' can be given to an operator "
"API account to restrict it to getting the list of webhooks or a webhook's "
"details."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions/post/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/secrets/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/secrets/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1apiPermissions~1{id}/patch/requestBody/content/application~1json/schema/properties/allowedOperations/properties/secrets/description
