#. (+1 more)
msgid ""
"The response contains a summary of requests by group. It can contain up to "
"10000 groups. If there are more than 10000 groups, the value of "
"\"isComplete\" will be false. A special group \"\\_\\_all\\_\\_\" contains "
"the total for all groups including those beyond the 10000 limit. When "
"\"isComplete\" is true, the total is the sum of all other returned groups."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/title
msgid "requestSummaryResponse"
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/metaData/properties/dataNames/description
msgid ""
"Indicates the type of data returned. \n"
"<table><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr><tr><td>edge request</"
"td><td>requests to edge servers</td></tr><tr><td>fast route request</"
"td><td>requests to your origin accelerated through the HDT product</td></"
"tr><tr><td>intermediate request</td><td>requests between CDN Pro servers</"
"td></tr><tr><td>origin request</td><td>requests to your origin server</td></"
"tr></table> The order of the entries in the <i>dataNames</i> array "
"corresponds to the order of values returned in the <i>data</i> array in the "
"response."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1reqSummary/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1report~1edgeStatusSummary/post/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/groups/description
