"Get a list of webhooks that have been defined. You can reference a webhook "
"when <a href=\"#operation/createDeployment\">creating a deployment task</a>, "
"<a href=\"#operation/createPurge\">creating a purge request</a>, <a "
"href=\"#operation/post-cdn-prefetches\">creating a prefetch request</a>, or "
"<a href=\"#operation/createValidationTask\">creating a validation task</a>."
