"href=\"#operation/get-cdn-serviceQuotas-customer-customerId\">service quota</"
"a> specifies a daily limit on prefetch requests. You can temporarily exceed "
"the limit during a day, but it will reduce the number of prefetches "
"available during the next day."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/summary
msgid "Get a list of origin shields"
