#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/region/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/region/description
msgid ""
"Indicates the region of the origin shield. It is typically an ISO-3166-1 "
"code representing a country. When choosing an origin shield for your "
"property, it is best to select one closer to your origin servers.\n"
"Use of a shield located in the \"cn\" region (China) requires your property "
"to have 'hasBeian' set to true which means all of its hostnames have an ICP "
"Beian license required by the Chinese government."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/ipV4/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipV4/description
msgid ""
"A list of IPv4 addresses used by the shield. If your origin server has an "
"access control list, include these IP addresses."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/shields/items/properties/ipV6/description
#. /paths/~1cdn~1shields~1{id}/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ipV6/description
msgid ""
"A list of IPv6 addresses used by the shield. If your origin server has an "
"access control list, include these IP addresses."
msgstr ""

