#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/responses/201/description
msgid ""
"The log aggregation point was sucessfully created. The Location header "
"contains a URL to the new log aggregation point. Example: <code>Location: "
"https://ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/logAggregationPoints/"
"123ab3dda4081d2ca71898fd</code>. \n"
"\n"
"The response body includes an ingestURL field containing a URL that can be "
"used in the <i>logUrl</i> field of the <a href=\"#operation/"
"createProperty\">realTimeLog setting in a property</a>."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/responses/201/content/application~1json/schema/properties/ingestURL/description
msgid ""
"Ingest URL of the log aggregation point. To use it, specify this URL in the "
"<i>logUrl</i> field of the realTimeLog setting of a property."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/responses/201/headers/Location/description
msgid ""
"URL to the new log aggregation point. The URL follows this format: https://"
"ngapi.{{siteDomain}}/cdn/logAggregationPoints/{logAggregationPointId} where "
"{logAggregationPointId} represents the ID of the newly created log "
"aggregation point. If you would like to get the log aggregation point ID, "
"simply extract the last portion of the path and ignore the rest. The ID can "
"be used to query, update, or delete the log aggregation point."
msgstr ""

#. /paths/~1cdn~1logAggregationPoints/post/responses/409/description
