"from children customers. <table><tr><th>Value</th><th>Behavior</th></"
"tr><tr><td>self-only</td><td>Include hostnames from the caller.</td></"
"tr><tr><td>children-only</td><td>Only hostnames owned by children customers "
"will be included.</td></tr><tr><td>self+children</td><td>Include data from "
"hostnames of both the caller and children customers.</td></tr></"
